Scope

The grant above covers this project's own work: the runtime, the import
bridges, the DirectDraw and DirectInput shims, the threading and input layers,
the lift drivers and the tooling and documentation. All of it was written for
this project.

It does not cover POD or POD Gold. The game's executable, data and assets
belong to Ubi Soft Entertainment and are not distributed here. Neither is the
lifted C: that is machine-translated from the original executable and carries
whatever rights the executable does, which is why it is generated on your
machine, from your copy, and never checked in.

The screenshots in docs/ show this project's output running against a disc you
must supply yourself. The artwork in them is the original game's, reproduced
here only to record how far the recompilation gets, and no claim is made to it.
